/* Default accent layer.
 *
 * emoji.rasi chains this file rather than the base theme
 * directly, so apollo-settings can recolour every rofi mode at once by
 * rewriting just this one file (see rofi.go / renderRofiColors).
 *
 * This checked-in version is a pass-through: it chains the base theme and
 * changes nothing. Without it the emoji picker would fail on a fresh clone,
 * before apollo-settings has ever been run.
 *
 * apollo-settings overwrites this file on Apply. That shows up as a tracked
 * change — which is the point: your accent is part of the rice. */

@theme "~/.config/rofi/themes/catppuccin-mocha.rasi"
